body: "## Outcome\nCost is a function of the answer, not the archive. The same binary serves a three-item scratch project created minutes ago and a million-item workspace spanning decades, with no special mode the agent has to know about.\n\n## Why this is a milestone, not an epic\npm-9rxu is the living execution epic. This milestone is the outcome gate: it declares the scale claims the GA contract is allowed to publish.\n\n## Delivery chain\npm-801d persistent derived read index -> pm-plwm index-backed --where predicates -> pm-0qg5 item-directory fan-out -> pm-lvyd claim throughput -> pm-o79o growth policy -> pm-5qmm memory tiers for decades-old epochs. Spectrum stories pm-g2zz (large) and pm-z436 (small) are the acceptance narratives.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNo daemon (ADR pm-i7i4). No external database requirement for the base install. No scale mode the agent has to opt into."
